{"3979490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AZUR", "steam_appid": 3979490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a9df325a0cc55c8f72de6bca79724877.webp?t=1779995128\" width=508 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The melting of the permafrost unleashed the Cryovore virus, poisoning the oceans and turning humans into water-starved creatures known as Riptides.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>On the island of Belmas, face other survivors or work together, secure your loot, and uncover what the Black Drip organization is hiding on this Mediterranean island.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a2d85c59baf7c2b21d5b0c7d2952d936.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a2d85c59baf7c2b21d5b0c7d2952d936.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A French island, a unique environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Mediterranean, where the song of cicadas drowns out the screams of survivors, and the salty breeze still carries the echoes of a lost world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget gray, frozen wastelands. Here, the sun beats down hard, facades crumble, and the sea is no longer welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belmas was once a postcard-perfect island, a peaceful place facing Marseille. Today, it is completely abandoned. Every location tells a story of tragedy, a secret, or a human mistake that should probably stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.mp4?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PvP-focused survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AZUR goes straight to the point and removes anything that slows the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No crafting, no endless menus, no routine. You spawn, you find a weapon, and you face what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights are fast, brutal, and unpredictable. Every shot matters, every move can save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your positioning and composure make the difference, keeping you alive on the island and earning you the favor of Black Drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.mp4?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Black Drip and loot storage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional extraction here. Black Drip runs its own storage system. Send your loot via helicopter or drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stored item goes into your offline inventory, letting you return with better gear for your current run or the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is free. Every drop draws attention, and a single moment of hesitation can cost you everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/8a726a7a153be7793bcce3997f24f096.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/8a726a7a153be7793bcce3997f24f096.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Missions, secrets, and Riptides</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Drip operations shape your journey. Defend strategic points, explore contaminated zones, infiltrate forgotten bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These missions reward rare loot, and more importantly, story fragments that reveal more about Cryovore and what it did to Belmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the island hides a clue, a trace of the past, or a warning most survivors never had time to read.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/ed43004ef4aab1d9a7323c3d220f6fd5.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/ed43004ef4aab1d9a7323c3d220f6fd5.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ranking and survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute alive counts, and every fight can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top players on the server appear live on Black Drip screens scattered across the island. Killers, Riptide hunters, and endurance survivors all leave a visible mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Belmas, everyone knows who you are, but no one knows where you are hiding.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a9df325a0cc55c8f72de6bca79724877.webp?t=1779995128\" width=508 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The melting of the permafrost unleashed the Cryovore virus, poisoning the oceans and turning humans into water-starved creatures known as Riptides.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>On the island of Belmas, face other survivors or work together, secure your loot, and uncover what the Black Drip organization is hiding on this Mediterranean island.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a2d85c59baf7c2b21d5b0c7d2952d936.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/a2d85c59baf7c2b21d5b0c7d2952d936.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A French island, a unique environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Mediterranean, where the song of cicadas drowns out the screams of survivors, and the salty breeze still carries the echoes of a lost world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget gray, frozen wastelands. Here, the sun beats down hard, facades crumble, and the sea is no longer welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belmas was once a postcard-perfect island, a peaceful place facing Marseille. Today, it is completely abandoned. Every location tells a story of tragedy, a secret, or a human mistake that should probably stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/cab95d3f29ca6fb9e87df580f5674a66.mp4?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PvP-focused survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AZUR goes straight to the point and removes anything that slows the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No crafting, no endless menus, no routine. You spawn, you find a weapon, and you face what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights are fast, brutal, and unpredictable. Every shot matters, every move can save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your positioning and composure make the difference, keeping you alive on the island and earning you the favor of Black Drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/3236963c3f77bf268b76a93f5f775e8b.mp4?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Black Drip and loot storage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No traditional extraction here. Black Drip runs its own storage system. Send your loot via helicopter or drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stored item goes into your offline inventory, letting you return with better gear for your current run or the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is free. Every drop draws attention, and a single moment of hesitation can cost you everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/8a726a7a153be7793bcce3997f24f096.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/8a726a7a153be7793bcce3997f24f096.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Missions, secrets, and Riptides</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Drip operations shape your journey. Defend strategic points, explore contaminated zones, infiltrate forgotten bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These missions reward rare loot, and more importantly, story fragments that reveal more about Cryovore and what it did to Belmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the island hides a clue, a trace of the past, or a warning most survivors never had time to read.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/ed43004ef4aab1d9a7323c3d220f6fd5.poster.avif?t=1779995128\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979490/extras/ed43004ef4aab1d9a7323c3d220f6fd5.webm?t=1779995128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ranking and survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute alive counts, and every fight can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top players on the server appear live on Black Drip screens scattered across the island. Killers, Riptide hunters, and endurance survivors all leave a visible mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Belmas, everyone knows who you are, but no one knows where you are hiding.</p>", "short_description": "Azur is a fast-paced PvP survival FPS set on the French island of Belmas. Every time you respawn, complete missions, explore, and survive as long as possible to secure the best gear, with the risk of losing everything.", "supported_languages": "English, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset